<section class="section how-section" style="text-align:center"><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center" style="color:#8BBC50">DentaVive Official Website</p><h1 class="s-heading center" style="color:#fff">DentaVive Oral Probiotic Supplement for a Balanced Mouth Microbiome</h1><p class="s-sub center" style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:0">One daily capsule that pairs five probiotic strains with a mineral and a prebiotic fiber, built to sit alongside your brushing and flossing routine.</p></div></section><div style="max-width:1300px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 5vw"><div class="hero" style="padding:0"><div class="hero-img-wrap"><div class="hero-img-placeholder"><img src="/assets/images/dentavive-hero.webp" alt="DentaVive oral probiotic bottle"></div></div><div><h2>What is DentaVive?</h2><p class="hero-desc"><strong>DentaVive</strong> is a dietary supplement made for adults who think of oral care as more than a clean surface. Rather than adding another rinse or paste, it supplies living bacteria, a calcium phosphate mineral, and fiber that feeds those bacteria, all in a single capsule you take once a day.</p><ul class="hero-bullets"><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> Five probiotic strains chosen for their link to the mouth</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> Tricalcium phosphate for the mineral side of the formula</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> Inulin prebiotic fiber to nourish the probiotics</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check-circle"></i> 60-day money-back guarantee and 3 free bonus guides</li></ul><h3>Save Up To 38% Today</h3><a href="https://dntavive.com/order" class="cta-btn" style="max-width:400px;display:inline-flex;text-decoration:none;"><i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i>See Pricing &amp; Order DentaVive</a></div></div></div><section class="section "><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">Understanding the oral microbiome</p><h2 class="s-heading center">Why the Bacteria in Your Mouth Matter</h2><p class="s-sub center">Your mouth hosts hundreds of bacterial species. What counts is not how few there are, but how well they are balanced.</p><div class="quote-block" style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto"><p>Every time you eat, sip, or breathe, you feed and shape a living community on your teeth, tongue, and gums. Many of these microbes are harmless or helpful. Trouble tends to start when the mix tips toward species that thrive on sugar and produce acid or odor compounds.</p><p>Mouthwash and toothpaste are useful tools for cleaning, but they act on the surface and for a short time. A microbiome-first approach asks a different question: how can we support the helpful residents so they hold their ground between brushings?</p><p>DentaVive was designed around that question. It is not an antiseptic. It is a daily supplement that supplies selected probiotic strains and the nutrients that go with them.</p></div><div class="callout-box" style="max-width:1000px;margin:10px auto 0">DentaVive is a dietary supplement that complements daily brushing, flossing, and regular dental visits. It is not a replacement for professional dental care.</div></div></section><section class="section gut-section"><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">Balance versus imbalance</p><h2 class="s-heading center">What a Balanced Mouth Looks Like</h2><p class="s-sub center">A quick comparison of the two ends of the spectrum.</p><div class="gut-grid"><div class="gut-side healthy"><div class="gut-side-title">Balanced Oral Microbiome</div><div class="gut-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i><p><strong>Diverse community</strong> where helpful bacteria leave less room for problem species.</p></div><div class="gut-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i><p><strong>Steadier acidity</strong> in the mouth between meals.</p></div><div class="gut-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i><p><strong>Comfortable gums</strong> with less everyday irritation.</p></div><div class="gut-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i><p><strong>Fresher breath</strong> that lasts longer than a mint.</p></div></div><div class="gut-side leaky"><div class="gut-side-title">Out-of-Balance Oral Microbiome</div><div class="gut-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark"></i><p><strong>Acid-producing species</strong> gain ground over helpful ones.</p></div><div class="gut-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark"></i><p><strong>More acidic conditions</strong> that can stress enamel over time.</p></div><div class="gut-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark"></i><p><strong>Tender, easily irritated gums.</strong></p></div><div class="gut-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark"></i><p><strong>Recurring odor</strong> that rinses only mask.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section how-section" style="background:var(--cream2)" id=how-it-works><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">The DentaVive approach</p><h2 class="s-heading center">How DentaVive Works: Repopulate, Remineralize, Sustain</h2><p class="s-sub center">Three jobs, one capsule.</p><div class="ben-left" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr))"><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-green"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Repopulate</div><p class="ben-text-p">Five probiotic strains add friendly bacteria to the community already in your mouth, supporting balance instead of wiping everything out.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-amber"><i class="fa-solid fa-tooth"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Remineralize</div><p class="ben-text-p">Tricalcium phosphate provides calcium and phosphate, the same kinds of minerals your teeth are built from.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Sustain</div><p class="ben-text-p">Inulin gives the probiotics something to feed on so they have a better chance to settle in with consistent daily use.</p></div></div></div><p class="s-sub center" style="margin-top:24px">Results vary between individuals, and DentaVive is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p></div></section><section class="ben-root"><div class="ben-inner"><h2 class="ben-head">Potential Benefits of Taking DentaVive</h2><p class="ben-sub">Designed to support, not to promise. Here is what each part of the formula is meant to do.</p><div class="ben-left"><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-green"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-heart"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Supports microbiome balance</div><p class="ben-text-p">Multi-strain probiotics aim to help keep the oral community diverse.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-amber"><i class="fa-solid fa-tooth"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Mineral support</div><p class="ben-text-p">Calcium phosphate supplies minerals used in tooth structure.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-rose"><i class="fa-solid fa-wind"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Fresher breath support</div><p class="ben-text-p">A balanced bacterial population is associated with fewer odor-causing compounds.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Prebiotic fiber included</div><p class="ben-text-p">Inulin nourishes the probiotic strains in the capsule.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-purple"><i class="fa-solid fa-capsules"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Easy daily habit</div><p class="ben-text-p">One capsule fits a morning or evening routine without extra steps.</p></div></div><div class="ben-card"><div class="ben-icon-wrap ic-teal"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"></i></div><div><div class="ben-text-h">Complements dental care</div><p class="ben-text-p">Works alongside brushing, flossing, and dentist visits.</p></div></div></div><div class="ben-cta-row"><a href="https://dntavive.com/order" class="bcta-btn" style="text-decoration:none"><i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i>Explore DentaVive</a><a href="https://dntavive.com/ingredients/" class="bcta-ghost"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial"></i>See Every Ingredient</a></div></div></section><section class="section ingr-section" id=ingredients><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">Inside every capsule</p><h2 class="s-heading center">The Seven DentaVive Ingredients</h2><p class="s-sub center">Five probiotic strains, one mineral, one prebiotic fiber. See the full breakdown on our <a href='/ingredients' style='color:var(--green);font-weight:700'>ingredients page</a>.</p><div class="ingr-grid"><article class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon"><img src="/assets/images/Ingredients/Lactobacillus%20reuteri.png" alt="Lactobacillus reuteri in DentaVive" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="ingr-role">Probiotic Strain</div><h3 class="ingr-name" style="font-size:24px">Lactobacillus reuteri</h3><div class="ingr-desc"><p><i>L. reuteri</i> is a lactic acid bacterium that occurs naturally in the human body, including the mouth, and it is one of the better-researched probiotic species in oral-health science. In DentaVive it is the first of five strains chosen to help keep the oral community diverse and balanced.</p></div></div></article><article class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon"><img src="/assets/images/Ingredients/Lactobacillus%20paracasei.png" alt="Lactobacillus paracasei in DentaVive" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="ingr-role">Probiotic Strain</div><h3 class="ingr-name" style="font-size:24px">Lactobacillus paracasei</h3><div class="ingr-desc"><p><i>L. paracasei</i> is a versatile species found in fermented foods and in the human body. It is included to widen the range of beneficial organisms in the formula instead of relying on a single strain.</p></div></div></article><article class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon"><img src="/assets/images/Ingredients/Bifidobacterium%20lactis%20BL-04.png" alt="Bifidobacterium lactis BL-04 in DentaVive" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="ingr-role">Probiotic Strain</div><h3 class="ingr-name" style="font-size:24px">Bifidobacterium lactis BL-04</h3><div class="ingr-desc"><p><i>Bifidobacterium lactis</i> BL-04 is a documented commercial strain that is widely used in probiotic supplements. It broadens the blend beyond the lactobacilli and adds to the formula's overall bacterial diversity.</p></div></div></article><article class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon"><img src="/assets/images/Ingredients/Lactobacillus%20salivarius.png" alt="Lactobacillus salivarius in DentaVive" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="ingr-role">Probiotic Strain</div><h3 class="ingr-name" style="font-size:24px">Lactobacillus salivarius</h3><div class="ingr-desc"><p>As its name suggests, <i>L. salivarius</i> is a species associated with the saliva-rich environment of the mouth. It is one of the five strains included to support a healthier oral bacterial balance.</p></div></div></article><article class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon"><img src="/assets/images/Ingredients/Streptococcus%20salivarius%20K12.png" alt="Streptococcus salivarius K12 in DentaVive" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="ingr-role">Probiotic Strain</div><h3 class="ingr-name" style="font-size:24px">Streptococcus salivarius K12</h3><div class="ingr-desc"><p><i>S. salivarius</i> K12 is one of the most widely studied oral probiotic strains and is often discussed in research on the mouth and throat microbiome.</p></div></div></article><article class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon"><img src="/assets/images/Ingredients/Tricalcium%20Phosphate.jpg" alt="Tricalcium Phosphate in DentaVive" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="ingr-role">Mineral Foundation</div><h3 class="ingr-name" style="font-size:24px">Tricalcium Phosphate</h3><div class="ingr-desc"><p>Tricalcium phosphate is a calcium phosphate mineral compound. Tooth enamel is made mostly of a related calcium phosphate mineral, which is why this ingredient is included as the mineral side of the formula.</p></div></div></article><article class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon"><img src="/assets/images/Ingredients/insulin.jpg" alt="Inulin in DentaVive" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="ingr-role">Prebiotic Fiber</div><h3 class="ingr-name" style="font-size:24px">Inulin</h3><div class="ingr-desc"><p>Inulin is a plant-based prebiotic fiber, meaning it is a food source for beneficial bacteria rather than a living organism itself. It is not insulin, the hormone, which is a common mix-up.</p></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="section "><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">Is it for you?</p><h2 class="s-heading center">Who DentaVive Is Made For</h2><div class="quote-block" style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto"><p>DentaVive suits adults who already brush and floss and want to add something that works on the microbial side of oral care. It may appeal to people who dislike harsh alcohol rinses, to those who like a simple capsule routine, and to anyone curious about the oral microbiome.</p><p>It is not for everyone. Talk to a healthcare professional before use if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, or managing a health condition, and see your dentist for any pain, bleeding, swelling, or persistent symptoms. A supplement is never a reason to delay care.</p><p><strong>A simple routine:</strong> take your capsule as directed on the label, keep brushing twice a day, floss daily, and book regular checkups. Consistency matters more than any single step.</p></div></div></section><section class="section ingr-section"><div class="section-inner"><p class="s-tag center">Free with every order</p><h2 class="s-heading center">3 Free Bonus Guides Worth $162</h2><p class="s-sub center">Digital extras that come with your order while supplies last.</p><div class="bonus-grid"><div class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon" style="background:var(--amber-light)"><img src="/assets/images/bonus1.png" alt="The Pompeii Protocol bonus guide" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="bonus-flag">Free Bonus #1</div><div class="bonus-name">The Pompeii Protocol <s>$67 Value</s></div><div class="bonus-desc">47-page guide on diet patterns, daily habits, and traditional practices linked with long-lasting teeth in ancient populations.</div></div></div><div class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon" style="background:var(--amber-light)"><img src="/assets/images/bonus2.png" alt="Emergency Dental Survival Guide bonus guide" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="bonus-flag">Free Bonus #2</div><div class="bonus-name">Emergency Dental Survival Guide <s>$43 Value</s></div><div class="bonus-desc">31-page guide with practical, time-tested tips for staying comfortable and acting sensibly until you can see a dentist.</div></div></div><div class="ingr-card" style="align-items:flex-start"><div class="ingr-icon" style="background:var(--amber-light)"><img src="/assets/images/bonus3.png" alt="The Oral-Body Connection bonus guide" loading="lazy"></div><div><div class="bonus-flag">Free Bonus #3</div><div class="bonus-name">The Oral-Body Connection <s>$52 Value</s></div><div class="bonus-desc">38-page guide on the link researchers are exploring between mouth bacteria and overall wellness.</div></div></div></div><p class="center" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin-top:20px">Bonus guides are digital, educational, and not a substitute for professional dental or medical advice.</p></div></section><section class="ps-root" id="pricing"><h2 class="ps-headline">Choos