rains are in DentaVive?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">Lactobacillus reuteri, Lactobacillus paracasei, Bifidobacterium lactis BL-04, Lactobacillus salivarius, and Streptococcus salivarius K12.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Why does DentaVive include tricalcium phosphate and inulin?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">Tricalcium phosphate is a calcium phosphate mineral related to the mineral in tooth enamel, and inulin is a prebiotic fiber that feeds the probiotic strains. Together they pair mineral support with microbiome support.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Can DentaVive replace brushing, flossing, or my dentist?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">No. DentaVive is designed to work alongside brushing, flossing, and regular professional checkups and cleanings, never in place of them.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How do I take DentaVive?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">Follow the serving directions on the bottle label and do not exceed the recommended serving. Check with a healthcare professional first if you are pregnant, nursing, managing a medical condition, or taking medication.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How long does it take to notice a difference?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">Experiences vary with diet, existing oral health, and consistency. DentaVive does not promise results in a set timeframe, which is one reason the 60-day guarantee exists.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What do the packages cost?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">Two bottles are $158 ($79 each), four bottles are $276 ($69 each), and six bottl