ation?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">Ask a healthcare professional first, especially if you take prescription medication or have a medical condition or a weakened immune system.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How long does one bottle last?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">The packages are listed as a 30-day supply per bottle: two bottles last 60 days, four bottles 120 days, and six bottles 180 days when taken as directed.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Does shipping cost extra?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">Four- and six-bottle orders include free US shipping. Review shipping details for smaller orders at checkout.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What are the three free bonus guides?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">The Pompeii Protocol, the Emergency Dental Survival Guide, and The Oral-Body Connection. They are digital, educational guides provided while supplies last.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-btn" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Where can I buy DentaVive?<i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></button><div class="faq-answer">DentaVive is available through its official website, so you receive current pricing, the 60-day guarantee, and the three free bonus guides.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="bottom-cta"><h2>Give Your Mouth Microbiome <span>The Support It Needs</span></h2><p>Five probiotic strains, tricalcium phosphate, and inulin in one daily capsule, with a 60-day guarantee and 3 free bonus guides.</p><a href="https://dntavive.com/order" class="cta-btn" style="max-width:400px;display:inline-flex;text-decoration:none;"><i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i>Explore DentaVive Today</a><div class="bottom-guarantee"><div class="b-g-item"><i class="fa-sol